<title>USA: FSA qualifies three muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies three muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Secaucus, N.J., $7.288 million improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Bridgewater Central School District, N.Y., $3.65 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--McMinnville, Ore., $7.415 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
